From: KV260 image builder <builder@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] media: xilinx: report the negotiated number of memory planes

S_FMT receives a zero-initialized num_planes from userspace. Return the
format table's buffer count, otherwise G_FMT advertises zero planes and
native NV12 consumers cannot validate the capture layout.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/xilinx-dma.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/xilinx/xilinx-dma.c
@@ -865,6 +865,8 @@
 		struct v4l2_plane_pix_format *plane_fmt;
 
 		pix_mp = &format->fmt.pix_mp;
+		/* V4L2 memory planes, not the number of Y/UV components. */
+		pix_mp->num_planes = info->buffers;
 		plane_fmt = pix_mp->plane_fmt;
 		pix_mp->field = dma->format.fmt.pix_mp.field;
 		width = rounddown(pix_mp->width * info->bpl_factor,
